  "title": "The experiencing subject is constituted by affect",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "ba720441-f1a8-4376-a2d4-f4d43215f343",
      "text": "The arousal processes conventionally called wakefulness constitute the experiencing subject: they are consciousness itself. Mental images can be experienced only by a conscious subject and are states of that subject.",
